00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:45.950
Episode 31 
Terror! The Ghosts
 of the Desert

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.830
They got us.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:51.660
Yes. We didn't expect an attack from under the sand.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.460
Let's see it.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.370
Yes, sir.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.590
These machines seem to be able to move through the sand.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.210
Image analysis confirms 18 of them.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.220
We've detected weak communication signals between them.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.930
They may be unmanned drones operating as a group.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.010
We can't confirm anything else.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.430
That would explain why we didn't see them.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.600
The Vagan really know what they're doing.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:15.560
Their weapons are so well adapted to Earth's environment.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.480
Is this the time to be impressed?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:18.730
No, I'm sorry.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.940
But this really is very interesting.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:26.660
How can they have stronger mobile suits than the Federation?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.410
Why do they have technology like the invisible umbrella?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.540
It's a fascinating mystery.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.840
Right now, we should be thinking of how to deal with this.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.010
Of course.

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:45.840
However... we barely managed to get away,

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.300
and some of the Diva's engines are damaged.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.770
We're barely able to move.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.680
And there's something else that bothers me.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.270
Why were there no mobile suits this time?

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:58.480
That's right.

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:00.400
The Phantom 3...

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.110
Excuse me.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.070
I just received some information.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:05.950
Read it.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.110
R-Right.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.410
During Vagan's mass attack,

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:14.830
a Federation ship in this area engaged the enemy and then stopped transmitting.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.040
A team was dispatched to find it, and they went missing as well.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:22.210
The last report of the ship that engaged them said there were three enemy mobile suits.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.970
They appear to have destroyed three of our ships and ten mobile suits.

00:05:25.970 --> 00:05:29.010
Central Command designated them as an unknown enemy unit,

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.760
and named them the Phantom 3.

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.890
The Phantom 3... The ghosts of the desert?

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.560
Why are we only getting this information now?!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.480
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.400
Now, now, no need to yell.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.900
But this makes one thing clear.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.410
The enemy will surely attack us again.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.080
And that's why we need to do everything we can.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.290
First, equip all mobile suits for desert use.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:54.910
Next...

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.670
I wonder what they're talking about.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.300
Hey! What are you doing there?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:06.800
Aunt Unoa!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:12.510
So you were assigned to this ship's medical crew.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.930
I got the transfer notice on Act 3. {personnel xfer notice}

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:17.850
I've been so busy that I haven't had time to talk to you.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.270
I'm glad I get to be on the same ship as you.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.820
Thanks.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.940
And I'm glad to be on the same ship as you and Dad.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.190
Oh, yeah.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.110
I got a message from Mom and Ms. Romary.

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.240
They evacuated to a neighboring town.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.200
