00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.180
Don't let it get away!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.510
Catch it!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.270
Wait!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.390
Huh? Those kids...

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.810
Hey! Wait up!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.440
Kio! Ms. Unoa!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.980
