00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.990
You focus on destroying the drones.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.280
Got it.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.540
Even when it's outfitted for desert combat, it still feels sluggish.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.120
But...

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:18.670
Kio Asuno, Gundam! Here I go!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.720
Be careful!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.350
It's easy to slip on the sand.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:41.860
Try not to lose your balance, even if you have to move slower.{Even if it means going slower, try not to lose your balance.}

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.610
Right!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.150
There you are, Gundam!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:47.280
An excellent trophy.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.740
Surround it, hit it, and blow it up!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.910
Something's coming!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:52.700
Intercept it!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:06.210
Kio!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.130
Let's go!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.380
{jet stream, errr}Delta Attack!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.820
What? I'm s{t}inking!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.030
Fly!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:27.570
Right!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.610
No you don't!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.620
Grandpa!

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:40.410
Now, let's finish you!

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:54.090
What?

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.350
It's not over yet!

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.400
There?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.320
I saw them...

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.410
Okay, good job!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.200
Right! Kio!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.580
Mr. Flit! It's all done!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.620
Your new wear part, the G-Hopper! {what adid we do before? wear part?}

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.290
Okay, launch it right away!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.460
We'll convert in midair!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.210
Got it.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.590
A mid-air conversion? Who'll pilot it?{Hm...regression in technology. No piloting needed in the past}

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.670
Guess I'll have to.

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:33.930
Mr. Rody!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.800
If it's just flying, I can do it

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.350
Then I'll go!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.680
Mr. Rody, the mechanic team needs you.

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:41.730
I'll fly it!

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:42.810
Wootbit!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.730
<i>Even that grinning idiot can do it.</i>

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.900
<i>So I can too!</i>

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.440
<i>Stay relaxed.</i>

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.070
<i>The autopilot will handle the precise maneuvering.</i>

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:53.820
Right!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.570
Wootbit Gunhale, G-Hopper, heading out!{noob mistake, leaning forward at launch}

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.500
Wow!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.340
Okay!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.840
What is that?

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.800
Who cares!

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:18.800
Shoot it down!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:29.860
Damn it!

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.940
Kio, mid-air conversion!{consistancy check? Mid-air or midair?}

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.530
Right!

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:37.660
Let's go!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.040
Did you think we'd just sit back and watch?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:56.800
Grandpa!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:57.930
Don't worry!

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.590
Dock quickly!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:00.350
Got it!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.060
What?

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:17.030
This is the AGE-3 Fortress.{Virtue is that you?}

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.920
So this is combat...

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.100
<i>What now?</i>

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.060
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.310
<i>Pound these three things into your head.</i>

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.940
He ran?

00:18:53.940 --> 00:18:55.070
After him!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.360
We'll finish him with another Delta Attack!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:57.900
Roger!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.200
<i>I get it!</i>

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:05.950
<i>Try to keep moving, so the enemy can't aim at you.</i>

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.750
He keeps jumping around!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.920
Clever rascal!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.260
<i>If you always know the enemy's location,</i>

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.840
<i>it's easier to dodge their attacks... and counterattack!</i>

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.010
There!

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:28.430
What?

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:34.020
Damn you!

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:37.360
And...

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.450
Don't let your guard down after you shoot!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.580
Deymon!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:54.000
Kio! I always knew you could do it! {you have lived up ;to  my expectations}

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.010
Grandpa, everybody, get out of the way!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.070
Unbelievable...

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.670
You okay?

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.380
Wootbit?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.050
Hey...

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:49.060
You're not so bad, Kio. Let's be friends!

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:51.680
Yeah!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:00.690
Rest in peace, brother.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:06.360
We <i>will</i>  avenge you!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.370
Ms. Shanalua!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.710
I did it!

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.630
I defeated one of the Phantom 3!

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:21.630
I remembered what you told me{the pounding bit}, and it worked!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.340
Does that make you happy?

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:27.590
There was a person in the mobile suit you shot down.

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:30.010
But they're the enemy!{flit's hate brainwashing is working}

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.770
Even the enemy has family!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:39.190
There's nothing to be happy about in war.{ in war we ought to be happy about.}

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.820
Ms. Shanalua...

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.990
You did well.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.490
Commander...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:51.950
Shanalua doesn't talk about herself much,

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.460
but she lost her parents to war, and her little sister is very sick.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.170
Oh, really?

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.580
I'm sorry.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:01.340
I said that to her...

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:06.930
Never mind. If you fret every time you defeat an enemy, you'll never last.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.300
There's nothing wrong with celebrating a victory.

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:12.720
Right.

